        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>5.5.4　把预算写成能采取行动的表</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>四类阈值，四种动作</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 14 }}>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6, width: 1152 }}>四条刻度分别对应量、钱、时间与数据可得性；到达之后的动作各不相同。</Text>

        <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 106, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 10, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, padding: '0 20px' }}>
